{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0033_1014_p", "source_sha256": "088913e98f7cb6ea4001bbe7d1c9ef345257d6dc0fa451490fb12fb0d12cfa5f", "ja": "（明日からまた新しい公演が始まる。\nリハーサルも終わったし、あとは……）", "zh": "（明天起又要展开新公演，\n排练也结束了，剩下的是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0033_1000_033sih", "source_sha256": "68278078232d694bf95e0080a8c2339dbd9703ffb17edfa92969c839e68b0816", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，你辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0033_1001_p", "source_sha256": "1c459dc6d5f5ac8dc7988e638bbc55c14bcdfe80eaf6e180c4f41346b5d38b57", "ja": "あれ、志保？\nまだ着替えてなかったのか？", "zh": "咦，志保？\n你还没换衣服啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0033_1002_033sih", "source_sha256": "fdc01c68608268fed03530c4c17f1d7cb66849303963b8756ac8165aa9e6e0e7", "ja": "ええ。\nダンスの振り付けに、心配なところがあったので。", "zh": "嗯，\n因为舞蹈动作里有几个地方让我不太安心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0033_1003_p", "source_sha256": "f8ddd72e6e975c106f14787debc8467bab0c15e23a81af0c976b910adbfa87fd", "ja": "そうか、居残りお疲れさま。でも、早く帰らないと\nいけないんだろ？　途中まで送っていくよ。", "zh": "这样啊，辛苦你留下来练习了。\n不过你得早点回去对不对？我送你到半路吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0033_1004_033sih", "source_sha256": "d172080a4e2ba722725a9a273b040895d47825fafdc12cf31e1f39e648465a5f", "ja": "……仕事は、いいんですか？", "zh": "……你的工作，没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0033_1005_p", "source_sha256": "0f5a05b3ac66dcade62f2c33994a3015bc781e011f7b7f6d895c0c8f73630b7b", "ja": "今日は余裕があるんだ。それに、アイドルの送迎も\n仕事のうち……だから、サボっているわけじゃないぞ？", "zh": "今天没那么忙啦，而且接送偶像也是工作之一……\n所以，我并不是在偷懒喔？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0033_1006_033sih", "source_sha256": "b77722289f6f6fffb1e0ec98dfeec88656a35d5a38d2bc6d0ecaacb6498da942", "ja": "別に、何も言ってませんけど……。\nところで、{$P$}さん。", "zh": "我什么都没说啊……\n话说回来，{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0033_1007_033sih", "source_sha256": "cded9e5bb89981c91f6644e1c616cfb2b4a06fc6ad35fea350649630ad597bd9", "ja": "ありがとうございました。", "zh": "非常谢谢你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0033_1008_p", "source_sha256": "d091ab2989d0bb202d5a34ed82030f9cc3e48502b0821415a549ac70c2999387", "ja": "……何の話だ？", "zh": "……这是在谢什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0033_1009_033sih", "source_sha256": "c359311bbfa59d407f76af49ee8de7736c8bf0e4ed9c8d491cc408bc0864793c", "ja": "何って……いえ、わからないならいいです。とにかく、\nクレシェンドブルーの時の話は、これで終わりです。", "zh": "你还问谢什么……不，不懂就算了。\n总之『Crescendo Blue』那次的事，就让它到此结束吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0033_1010_p", "source_sha256": "fe56407a7e0f3583005fa8dcfc8973577f1daaa69c84a861644494f5b34029e1", "ja": "（クレシェンドブルーのことだったのか……）", "zh": "（原来是指『Crescendo Blue』的事啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0033_1011_033sih", "source_sha256": "169cd19fda87fa3b03722e789f9ae5d2a13fa1e2182a68557da054ebf2574ecc", "ja": "話は、それだけです。\n私はひとりで帰れますから。それじゃ。", "zh": "我的话说完了。\n我自己一个人也可以回去的，那我走了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0033_1012_p", "source_sha256": "6f22356dec29382ba8ca276c8c42a8e35c3a11fe961b62a1032fa845787e4944", "ja": "あっ、志保……いっちゃったか。", "zh": "啊，志保……走掉了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0033_1013_p", "source_sha256": "e76045c67ba4111f5ab6dd76191289ee498dd97032739caed65d0dff0bcd5ff7", "ja": "（志保なりに、気にしてたんだな。クレシェンド\nブルーの時の話……。また今度、みんなで話そう）", "zh": "（志保还在意着『Crescendo Blue』\n那次的事吗……下次再和大家说吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
